# Live then staging Git

Kerja kode di live (`public_html` / SSH). Staging hanya lewat Git `masterstaging` → Hostinger path `revampstaging2025`.

Jika user bilang **sudah benar** (atau “oke sudah benar”, “commit ke staging”): langsung commit file kerja saja lalu `git push origin masterstaging`. Jangan `git add -A`. Jangan commit vendor, uploads, wp-config.

Detail: `WORKFLOW-LIVE-THEN-STAGING.md`.
